        "original_id": "3102dbb0-f548-5f2f-bbcf-a25cd85916a7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: William Sadler, Pete Hewitt, Walter Hill, Bruce Willis, Bill Paxton, Ice Cube, Ice-T\n- Films: Bill & Ted's Bogus Journey, Trespass, The Shawshank Redemption, Hard to Kill, Die Hard 2\n- Television Series: The Pacific, Roswell\n- Roles: Chesty Puller, Sheriff Jim Valenti, Heywood, Senator Vernon Trent, the Grim Reaper, Colonel Stuart\n- Awards: Saturn Award for Best Supporting Actor\n\nFacts:\n- Bill & Ted's Bogus Journey is a 1991 American science fiction comedy film and was Pete Hewitt's directing debut.\n- Trespass is a 1992 crime drama film directed by Walter Hill and starring Bill Paxton, Ice Cube, Ice-T, and William Sadler.\n- William Sadler played the Grim Reaper in Bill & Ted's Bogus Journey and won the Saturn Award for Best Supporting Actor for that role.\n- William Sadler played Colonel Stuart opposite Bruce Willis in Die Hard 2.\n- William Sadler played Senator Vernon Trent in Hard to Kill.\n- William Sadler played convict Heywood in The Shawshank Redemption.\n- William Sadler played Sheriff Jim Valenti in Roswell.\n- William Sadler played Lewis Burwell \"Chesty\" Puller in The Pacific.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
